## Contribution and review

Contributors are welcome to propose improvements through pull requests. Changes to reusable workflow inputs, secrets, artifact formats, runner assumptions, or deployment behavior require maintainer review because they can affect external repositories.

When changing a workflow:

- explain the compatibility impact in the pull request;
- update [`README.md`](../README.md) when its public contract changes;
- validate YAML syntax and the relevant workflow path;
- keep credentials and other sensitive values out of source control.

